<title>USA: Oncogene, Xenometrix in pact.</title>
<headline>Oncogene, Xenometrix in pact.</headline>
<dateline>UNIONDALE, N.Y. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oncogene Science Inc said Tuesday that it and Xenometrix Inc have formed a strategic alliance to develop and implement technologies based on gene profiling that for the rapid conversion of lead compounds into high quality drug candidates.</p>
<p>Ondogene said that the alliance will seek a major pharmaceutical partner to fund a significant portion of the development of automated systems.</p>
<p>The systems will generate and analyze data on the effects of drug candidates on the expression of target genes associated with toxicological, metabolic, and undesirable systemic effects of drug candidates.</p>
</text>
